{"strongs": "H4438", "word": "מַלְכוּת", "translit": "mal.khut", "root": "מלך", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "royalty, royal power, reign, kingdom", "definition": "מַלְכוּת noun feminine royalty, royal power, reign, kingdom (chiefly late); — ׳ מ absolute Esth 1:9 +; construct 1Chr 12:23 +; suffix מַלְכוּתִי 1Chr 17:14 , etc.; plural מַלְכֻיּוֺת Dan 8:22 — 1. royal power, dominion Num 24:7 (with תִּנַשֵּׂא ), 1Sam 20:31 (with תִּכּוֺן ), 1Kgs 2:12 (c. id. ); compare Jer 10:7 ; Eccl 4:14 ; 1Chr 11:10 ; 1Chr 12:23 ; 1Chr 29:30 (|| גְּבוּרָה ), 2Chr 33:13 ; Esth 1:19 , royal (queenly) dignity Esth 4:14 ; 1Chr 14:2 (with נִשֵּׂאת ); with לָכַד Dan 11:21 with הֵכִין (subject ׳ י ) 1Chr 17:11 ; 1Chr 28:7 ; 2Chr 12:1 (subject Rehob.); Israel royalty as belonging to ׳ י 1Chr 17:14 dominion of ׳ י Ps 103:19 (with מָֽשְׁלָה ), Ps 145:13 (twice in verse); ׳ כְּבוֺד מ v Ps 145:11 ׳ כְּבוֺד הֲדַר מ v Ps 145:12 ׳ שֵׁבֶט מ Ps 45:7 ׳ כִּסֵּא מ 1Chr 22:10 ; 1Chr 28:5 ; 2Chr 7:18 of Persia Esth 1:2 ; Esth 5:1 ׳ בַּיִת לְמ 2Chr 1:18 ; 2Chr 2:11 ׳ בֵּית מ Esth 1:9 ; Esth 2:16 ; Esth 5:1 (compare Assyrian bit šarruti Dl HWB 171 ); ׳ יֵין מ royal wine Esth 1:7 ׳ דְּבַר מ royal command Esth 1:19 ׳ הוֺד מ royal honour, majesty 1Chr 29:25 ; Dan 11:21 so perhaps also ׳ הֶדֶר מ Dan 11:20 see Bev ; ׳ עשֶׁר בְּבוֺד מ Esth 1:4 ׳ כֶּתֶר מ royal crown Esth 1:11 ; Esth 2:17 ; Esth 6:8 ׳ לְבוּשׁ מ royal apparel Esth 6:8 ; Esth 8:15 ׳ מ ( לְבוּשׁ omitted) Esth 5:1 ( queenly attire ). 2. reign: 40th year of reign of David 1Chr 26:31 compare 2Chr 3:2 ; 2Chr 15:10 ; 2Chr 15:19 ; 2Chr 16:1 ; 2Chr 16:12 ; 2Chr 35:19 ; Jer 49:34 ; Dan 1:1 also 2Chr 29:19 of Babylonian and Persian kings Jer 52:31 ( ׳ בִּשְׁנַת מ || 2Kgs 25:27 מָלְכוֺ ) Dan 2:1 ; Dan 8:1 ; Ezra 4:5 ; Ezra 4:6 (twice in verse); Ezra 7:1 ; Ezra 8:1 ; Neh 12:22 ; Esth 2:16 compare עַדמְֿלֹח מַלְכוּת פָּרָס 2Chr 36:20 . 3. kingdom, realm 2Chr 1:1 ; 2Chr 11:17 ; 2Chr 20:30 ; Neh 9:35 especially realm of Babylonia and Persia 2